    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The hired gun coach, John Tortorella, orchestrated a magic carpet ride for Vegas, guiding them to a clean sweep of the series after a desperate mid-stream sacking earlier in the season. The Knights from Vegas now book their ticket to the big dance, while the snowbound casualties from Colorado are left embarrassed and sent home, their talent having evaporated at the worst possible moment.",
