    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "A lucky streak for Tortorella saw Vegas barely squeak by in Game 4, completing a total demolition of the Avalanche and stumbling into the Stanley Cup Final. The missing engine, Nathan MacKinnon, and the expensive paperweight, Cale Makar, could only watch from the infirmary as their team's season ended with a whimper against the desert gladiators.",
